var e=[{id:`valen-korr`,name:`Valen Korr`,calling:`The Bell-Warden`,faction:`solaris-bastion`,factionText:`The Solaris Bastion`,region:`sun-steppe-of-aethel`,regionText:`The Sun-Steppe of Aethel`,role:`tank`,roleText:`Tank (Frontline Mitigation & Acoustic Crowd Control)`,hook:`A towering, granite-skinned Korvath sentinel who absorbs the fury of the storm into his great bell-bronze shield and rings it back as an unbreakable wall of golden sound.`,kindred:`Korvath`,image:`characters/valen-korr/splash`,kind:`full`,revealed:!0,title:`First Shield of the Viaduct`,portrait:`characters/valen-korr/portrait`,story:[`For forty Turns, Valen Korr stood watch over the Viaduct of Ten Chords, the monumental two-mile bridge that carries both the golden waters of Mount Aethel and the western pilgrim trains into the heart of High Solitude. Born among the highland Korvath clans—a people whose slate-grey skin carries the natural density and grain of mountain limestone—Valen rose to command the Order of the Uncracked Bell not through noble birth, but through sheer, immovable endurance. During the Corsair raids of 598 FS, when a sabotage bomb blew out the central arch of the Viaduct, Valen braced his own shoulders between the collapsing keystone and a fully loaded passenger carriage, holding forty tons of masonry in place for twenty minutes until the Sun-Smiths could weld temporary bronze struts beneath him.`,`When Sol-Vara cracked in 609 FS, Valen was leading an honor guard escorting Bastion diplomats to the base of the First Spire. He witnessed the blinding birth of the Pale Wake firsthand. As the wave of Dead-Pitch silence swept down the mountain, Valen slammed his great tower shield—cast from a reclaimed piece of an ancient Spire bell—into the stone and struck it with his mace. The resonant dome of golden sound he created saved nineteen recruits huddled behind him, though the edges of the blast caught his own left forearm, turning the stone-flesh of his wrist into permanent, unfeeling white porcelain.`,`The Sun-Priors of the Solaris Bastion offered Valen a quiet retirement as a palace instructor, fearing that the glassed scar on his arm might spread if he returned to the northern front. Valen refused. Having seen High Commander Veyra, the comrade he loved best, walk willingly into the silver storm, he marched out of High Solitude at the head of a volunteer vanguard. He has sworn a personal oath: he will stand between the living world and the Choir of the Pale Wake until either the First Spire is mended, or there is nothing left of him but a statue still blocking the road.`],playstyle:{description:`Valen Korr is an immovable frontline fortress whose gameplay revolves around turning enemy aggression into party-wide protection. Every time Valen blocks an attack or takes damage, his shield accumulates Bell-Charge (0 to 100). Rather than passively soaking hits, players must time their defensive cooldowns to absorb massive boss strikes and then "ring" their shield, expending Bell-Charge to unleash golden shockwaves that taunt enemies, shatter Vitrified armor, and grant warm Amber-glass barriers to nearby allies. He feels weighty, rhythmic, and deliberate—rewarding players who learn boss swing timers and position themselves as the literal anchor of the group.`,resource:`Bell-Charge (Builds from 0 to 100 on blocks and hits taken; spent on resonant slams and protective chords)`,difficulty:1,difficultyText:`1 / 3 (Accessible, forgiving, clear visual rhythm)`,weapons:`Tower Bell-Shield & One-Handed Resonance Mace / War-Gavel`,armour:`Heavy Sun-Forged Plate`},visual:{silhouette:`A colossal, broad-shouldered rectangle of a man standing nearly eight feet tall, with a wide, grounded stance dominated by an oversized curved tower shield on his left arm and a heavy flanged mace in his right hand; three short brass chime-pipes rise vertically from the back of his pauldrons.`,face:`A weathered, noble Korvath face in his late fifties with skin the color and texture of chiseled slate-grey granite; a square jaw with a neat, braided beard of silver-white hair bound in gold clasps; warm, glowing amber eyes; a deep vertical chip across his left brow like carved stone.`,armour:`Layered plates of burnished gold-bronze and polished ivory-white enamel over a dark cobalt-blue quilted gambeson; his left forearm gauntlet is missing, revealing a hand and wrist transformed into smooth, glowing white porcelain veined with silver cracks.`,colours:`Burnished Gold, Ivory White, Cobalt Blue, and Slate Grey.`,weapon:`Toll of Aethel, a five-foot tall concave tower shield cast from thick green-patina bell-bronze with a raised golden sun-rose embossing at its center, paired with Gavel of the Tenth Chord, a heavy brass-headed war-mace whose hollow core glows with liquid orange Sun-Pitch.`,pose:`Planted in a low, wide defensive brace, left foot forward, driving the bottom spike of his giant bell-shield into the ground while drawing back his glowing war-mace to strike the inner rim of his own shield like a gong.`,effect:`Concentric, rippling rings of translucent golden-amber light and visible musical staff-lines that expand outward along the ground from his shield, leaving warm, glowing geometric ward-runes burned into the earth beneath his boots.`},art:`A colossal, broad-shouldered rectangle of a man standing nearly eight feet tall, with a wide, grounded stance dominated by an oversized curved tower shield on his left arm and a heavy flanged mace in his right hand; three short brass chime-pipes rise vertically from the back of his pauldrons.

A weathered, noble Korvath face in his late fifties with skin the color and texture of chiseled slate-grey granite; a square jaw with a neat, braided beard of silver-white hair bound in gold clasps; warm, glowing amber eyes; a deep vertical chip across his left brow like carved stone.

Layered plates of burnished gold-bronze and polished ivory-white enamel over a dark cobalt-blue quilted gambeson; his left forearm gauntlet is missing, revealing a hand and wrist transformed into smooth, glowing white porcelain veined with silver cracks.

Burnished Gold, Ivory White, Cobalt Blue, and Slate Grey.

Toll of Aethel, a five-foot tall concave tower shield cast from thick green-patina bell-bronze with a raised golden sun-rose embossing at its center, paired with Gavel of the Tenth Chord, a heavy brass-headed war-mace whose hollow core glows with liquid orange Sun-Pitch.

Planted in a low, wide defensive brace, left foot forward, driving the bottom spike of his giant bell-shield into the ground while drawing back his glowing war-mace to strike the inner rim of his own shield like a gong.

Concentric, rippling rings of translucent golden-amber light and visible musical staff-lines that expand outward along the ground from his shield, leaving warm, glowing geometric ward-runes burned into the earth beneath his boots.`,branches:[{id:`the-unbroken-bastion`,name:`The Unbroken Bastion`,focus:`Mitigation & Self-Sustain`,theme:`Turn your body and shield into an impenetrable wall of bronze and stone that thrives under heavy fire.`,skills:[{id:`brace-the-arch`,name:`Brace the Arch`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Slam your shield into the earth for 4 seconds, reducing all incoming damage by 40% and generating 10 Bell-Charge each time you are struck. While braced, you cannot be knocked back, pulled, or petrified. (Cost: None | Cooldown: 12s | Range: Self)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/valen-korr/brace-the-arch`,art:`A heavy bronze tower shield wedged deep into cracked grey stone, surrounded by an upward-rising aura of warm golden light.`,cooldown:`12s`,cooldownSeconds:12,range:{kind:`self`,text:`Self`},cost:{kind:`none`,text:`None`}},{id:`limestone-marrow`,name:`Limestone Marrow`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Your Korvath constitution hardens under pressure: whenever your Bell-Charge exceeds 50, your maximum health is increased by 12% and you regenerate 2% of your maximum health every 3 seconds. (Passive)`,requires:[`brace-the-arch`],icon:`skills/valen-korr/limestone-marrow`,art:`A stylized grey stone heart bound in a cage of glowing gold filigree against a deep cobalt background.`},{id:`counter-toll`,name:`Counter-Toll`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Strike the inside of your shield immediately after blocking an attack to unleash a focused sonic blast, dealing 900 Resonant damage in a 10-meter cone and stunning all struck enemies for 1.5 seconds. Grants a 2,200-health Amber Barrier for 6 seconds. (Cost: 30 Bell-Charge | Cooldown: 20s | Range: 10m Cone)`,requires:[`limestone-marrow`],icon:`skills/valen-korr/counter-toll`,art:`A brass gavel striking the center of a golden bell-shield, sending out three sharp crescent waves of bright orange light.`,cooldown:`20s`,cooldownSeconds:20,range:{kind:`cone`,text:`10m Cone`,meters:10},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`30 Bell-Charge`,amount:30,resource:`Bell-Charge`,unit:`points`}},{id:`keystone-of-the-viaduct`,name:`Keystone of the Viaduct`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Become a living monument for 8 seconds, growing 25% in size, reducing all damage taken by 70%, and redirecting 50% of all damage dealt to allies within 15 meters directly to yourself. When the effect ends, release a shockwave dealing 25% of all damage absorbed as golden fire to nearby foes. Brace the Arch’s damage reduction also applies to allies within 8 meters. (Cost: 80 Bell-Charge | Cooldown: 90s | Range: 15m Radius)`,requires:[`counter-toll`],icon:`skills/valen-korr/keystone-of-the-viaduct`,art:`A glowing golden keystone arch crowned with a miniature white fortress, radiating intense saffron beams against a dark blue sky.`,amplifies:`brace-the-arch`,cooldown:`90s`,cooldownSeconds:90,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`15m Radius`,meters:15},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`80 Bell-Charge`,amount:80,resource:`Bell-Charge`,unit:`points`}}]},{id:`resonant-bulwark`,name:`Resonant Bulwark`,focus:`Party Protection & Ward Support`,theme:`Project the protective acoustic dome of a Chime-Spire across your entire party to cleanse silence and shield the weak.`,skills:[{id:`chord-of-sanctuary`,name:`Chord of Sanctuary`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Ring a low, warming note from your mace, creating a 12-meter golden acoustic dome on the ground for 8 seconds. Allies standing inside take 15% less damage and are immune to Dead-Pitch Calcification stacks. Grants a 1,500-health Amber Barrier and generates 15 Bell-Charge. (Cost: None | Cooldown: 18s | Range: 12m Radius)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/valen-korr/chord-of-sanctuary`,art:`A translucent dome of golden amber glass enclosing a glowing white cross-chime over dark ground.`,cooldown:`18s`,cooldownSeconds:18,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`12m Radius`,meters:12},cost:{kind:`none`,text:`None`}},{id:`echoing-aegis`,name:`Echoing Aegis`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Whenever you gain a personal shield or barrier, 30% of that barrier's value is automatically granted to the two lowest-health allies within 20 meters for 5 seconds. (Passive)`,requires:[`chord-of-sanctuary`],icon:`skills/valen-korr/echoing-aegis`,art:`Two overlapping smaller bronze shields flanking a large central gold shield, connected by a glowing ribbon of amber light.`},{id:`guard-the-pilgrim`,name:`Guard the Pilgrim`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Leap up to 20 meters toward a targeted ally, intercepting the next attack made against them within 4 seconds and granting both of you a 3,100-health Amber Barrier. Generates 25 Bell-Charge if an attack is intercepted. (Cost: None | Cooldown: 20s | Range: 20m)`,requires:[`echoing-aegis`],icon:`skills/valen-korr/guard-the-pilgrim`,art:`A pair of heavy golden plate gauntlets clasped protectively around a glowing white lantern flame.`,cooldown:`20s`,cooldownSeconds:20,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`20m`,meters:20},cost:{kind:`none`,text:`None`}},{id:`the-first-striking`,name:`The First Striking`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Summon a spectral projection of Sol-Vara's Prime Bell above the party and strike it, instantly cleansing all harmful effects from allies within 25 meters, granting them 4,500 Amber Barrier health, and increasing party haste by 20% for 10 seconds. (Cost: 60 Bell-Charge | Cooldown: 120s | Range: 25m Radius)`,requires:[`guard-the-pilgrim`],icon:`skills/valen-korr/the-first-striking`,art:`A colossal verdigris-and-gold bell suspended in mid-air, shattering a ring of silver-white ice into warm golden sparks.`,amplifies:`chord-of-sanctuary`,cooldown:`120s`,cooldownSeconds:120,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`25m Radius`,meters:25},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`60 Bell-Charge`,amount:60,resource:`Bell-Charge`,unit:`points`}}]},{id:`earth-shaker`,name:`Earth-Shaker`,focus:`Crowd Control & Threat Generation`,theme:`Channel heavy sub-bass vibrations through the fault lines to shatter enemy formations and command the battlefield.`,skills:[{id:`gavel-of-judgement`,name:`Gavel of Judgement`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Smash your war-mace down, dealing 1,100 Physical damage to the target and sending a seismic fissure 15 meters forward that deals 750 Resonant damage and generates high threat against all enemies in its path. Generates 15 Bell-Charge. (Cost: None | Cooldown: 6s | Range: 15m Line)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/valen-korr/gavel-of-judgement`,art:`A heavy brass war-mace slamming into black stone, splitting it open with a jagged crack of bright molten gold.`,cooldown:`6s`,cooldownSeconds:6,range:{kind:`line`,text:`15m Line`,meters:15},cost:{kind:`none`,text:`None`}},{id:`fault-line-tremor`,name:`Fault-Line Tremor`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Your ground-slam abilities leave behind vibrating bronze fault-lines for 5 seconds that slow enemy movement speed by 40% and cause affected enemies to deal 10% reduced damage. (Passive)`,requires:[`gavel-of-judgement`],icon:`skills/valen-korr/fault-line-tremor`,art:`A cracked black basalt tile glowing with three parallel lines of vibrating orange-gold energy.`},{id:`magnetic-pitch`,name:`Magnetic Pitch`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Strike a deep sub-audible note that ripples outward, pulling up to 6 enemies within 15 meters directly toward your shield, dealing 980 Resonant damage and forcing them to attack you for 4 seconds. (Cost: 35 Bell-Charge | Cooldown: 24s | Range: 15m Radius)`,requires:[`fault-line-tremor`],icon:`skills/valen-korr/magnetic-pitch`,art:`A glowing bronze tuning-fork surrounded by four inward-pointing cobalt-blue arrows pulling silver shards toward the center.`,cooldown:`24s`,cooldownSeconds:24,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`15m Radius`,meters:15},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`35 Bell-Charge`,amount:35,resource:`Bell-Charge`,unit:`points`}},{id:`sundering-cadence`,name:`Sundering Cadence`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Deliver a rhythmic three-hit combo with shield and mace over 2.5 seconds, dealing a total of 2,400 Resonant damage in a 10-meter radius; the final hit shatters enemy armor, increasing all damage they take from your party by 15% for 12 seconds and knocking them airborne. (Cost: 50 Bell-Charge | Cooldown: 60s | Range: 10m Radius)`,requires:[`magnetic-pitch`],icon:`skills/valen-korr/sundering-cadence`,art:`An anvil splitting in half beneath a blinding golden shockwave, surrounded by flying shards of white crystal.`,amplifies:`gavel-of-judgement`,cooldown:`60s`,cooldownSeconds:60,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`10m Radius`,meters:10},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`50 Bell-Charge`,amount:50,resource:`Bell-Charge`,unit:`points`}}]}],quotes:[`"Stand behind the bronze, little bird. Let the storm break its teeth on me first."`,`"A crack in the stone does not mean the arch has fallen. It only means the keystone must bear a heavier load."`,`"Veyra thought silence was peace. Come on then, Choir! Hear how loud the living still sing!"`]},{id:`lyra-vance`,name:`Lyra Vance`,calling:`The Lantern-Weaver`,faction:`verdant-chorus`,factionText:`The Verdant Chorus`,region:`whispering-fen-root-basin`,regionText:`The Whispering Fen & Root-Basin`,role:`healer`,roleText:`Healer (Mobile Restorative Support & Bioluminescent Buffs)`,hook:`A graceful Auralin mystic who swings a censer of living swamp-light and golden Amber-glass, weaving warm ribbons of melody between her allies to mend wounds and bloom protective flora.`,kindred:`Auralin`,image:`characters/lyra-vance/splash`,kind:`full`,revealed:!0,title:`Keeper of the Singing Cataracts`,portrait:`characters/lyra-vance/portrait`,story:[`Born high in the banyan canopy of Root-Cradle, Lyra Vance belongs to the Auralin—the long-eared, sylvan kindred whose sensitive hearing allows them to perceive the subtle cellular hum of growing roots and flowing sap. As a young apprentice to the Chorus’s River-Singers, Lyra spent her twenties paddling narrow reed-skiffs through the darkest reaches of the Whispering Fen, tending the bioluminescent Lantern-Lilies that absorb stray Sun-Pitch from the water and convert it into gentle, healing warmth for the marsh villages.`,`When the central Chime-Spire of the marsh—Spire Verdan—began to choke under parasitic crystal vines two Turns ago, the sudden acoustic dissonance drove the giant river-turtles and marsh-drakes into a murderous frenzy. Lyra’s mentor sacrificed himself to hold open the floodgates while the lower villages evacuated, passing his ancestral Censer of the First Bloom into her hands. Refusing to abandon the wounded wildlife or the drowned lower wards, Lyra discovered she could blend the wild, chaotic spore-light of the Fen with the refined golden Amber-glass of the surface cities, creating a hybrid resonance that dissolved crystal corruption without harming the living host beneath.`,`Word of the "Lantern-Weaver of the Cataracts" quickly spread beyond the southern jungles. When the neutral Wayfarer Lantern called for healers capable of reversing the early stages of Dead-Pitch calcification on the northern front, Lyra packed her vials of glowing marsh-dew, slung her staff-censer over her shoulder, and traveled north. Warm, quick-witted, and fiercely protective of anyone under her care, she views a raid party much like a complex forest ecosystem: keep the roots watered and the light moving, and nothing can freeze them.`],playstyle:{description:`Lyra Vance is a highly mobile, proactive "harmony healer" who excels at keeping an entire moving party alive through interconnected tethers of light and ground-blooming sanctuaries. Rather than standing still to cast slow, single-target heals, Lyra weaves Tether-Chords between allies and swings her censer on the move, building Bloom-Light (1 to 5 Petals). When her five Petals are fully lit, she can trigger a Full Chorus, causing every tethered ally and active marsh-flower on the battlefield to erupt with simultaneous healing bursts and haste buffs. She feels fluid, musical, and rewarding for players who love positioning and group synergy.`,resource:`Mana & Bloom-Light (5-Petal gauge that fills as she heals and damages; spent on instant party-wide blooms)`,difficulty:2,difficultyText:`2 / 3 (Moderate; requires good positioning and managing ally tether lines)`,weapons:`Lantern-Staff (Pole-Censer) / Off-Hand Chime-Bell & Wand`,armour:`Light Sylvan-Woven Silk & Bark-Leather`},visual:{silhouette:`Tall, lithe, and dancer-like (around six feet two inches), with an asymmetrical, flowing silhouette created by long leaf-shaped cloak ribbons, sweeping Auralin ears, and a seven-foot curved ironwood staff from which a large glowing glass lantern swings on a bronze chain.`,face:`Warm olive-tan skin dusted with faint, natural bioluminescent turquoise freckles across her cheekbones; expressive, tilted golden-amber eyes; eight-inch tapering sylvan ears adorned with tiny copper bell-studs; thick, wavy auburn-red hair worn in a loose side-braid woven with glowing white marsh-orchids.`,armour:`Layered robes of verdigris-green marsh-silk, supple bark-brown leather corsetry embossed with leaf veins, and shoulder-guards formed from polished turquoise river-turtle shell inlaid with spun gold.`,colours:`Verdigris Green, Bioluminescent Turquoise, Warm Amber Yellow, and Bark Brown.`,weapon:`Whisper-Cradle, a curved staff of living dark ironwood whose crook sprouts real glowing blue moss; suspended from its tip on three brass chains is a faceted globe of golden Amber-glass housing a floating, swirling lotus of turquoise fire.`,pose:`Caught mid-step as if dancing across water, one hand raised to pluck a glowing golden string of light in the air while the other swings her lantern-staff in a wide, graceful figure-eight arc around her hips.`,effect:`Ribbons of warm golden light braided with sparkling turquoise spore-dust that arch from her lantern to her allies' chests, while translucent glowing water-lilies bloom and ripple beneath her feet with every spell cast.`},art:`Tall, lithe, and dancer-like (around six feet two inches), with an asymmetrical, flowing silhouette created by long leaf-shaped cloak ribbons, sweeping Auralin ears, and a seven-foot curved ironwood staff from which a large glowing glass lantern swings on a bronze chain.

Warm olive-tan skin dusted with faint, natural bioluminescent turquoise freckles across her cheekbones; expressive, tilted golden-amber eyes; eight-inch tapering sylvan ears adorned with tiny copper bell-studs; thick, wavy auburn-red hair worn in a loose side-braid woven with glowing white marsh-orchids.

Layered robes of verdigris-green marsh-silk, supple bark-brown leather corsetry embossed with leaf veins, and shoulder-guards formed from polished turquoise river-turtle shell inlaid with spun gold.

Verdigris Green, Bioluminescent Turquoise, Warm Amber Yellow, and Bark Brown.

Whisper-Cradle, a curved staff of living dark ironwood whose crook sprouts real glowing blue moss; suspended from its tip on three brass chains is a faceted globe of golden Amber-glass housing a floating, swirling lotus of turquoise fire.

Caught mid-step as if dancing across water, one hand raised to pluck a glowing golden string of light in the air while the other swings her lantern-staff in a wide, graceful figure-eight arc around her hips.

Ribbons of warm golden light braided with sparkling turquoise spore-dust that arch from her lantern to her allies' chests, while translucent glowing water-lilies bloom and ripple beneath her feet with every spell cast.`,branches:[{id:`living-tether`,name:`Living Tether`,focus:`Single-Target & Linked Healing`,theme:`Bind your allies together with unbroken chords of warm light so that healing one mends them all.`,skills:[{id:`thread-of-warmth`,name:`Thread of Warmth`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Weave a golden chord of light to an ally, instantly healing them for 1,250 health and linking yourself to them for 12 seconds. While linked, 35% of all healing you do to any target is also duplicated onto your linked ally. Generates 1 Petal of Bloom-Light. (Cost: 4% Mana | Cooldown: None | Range: 30m)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/thread-of-warmth`,art:`Two glowing golden rings connected by a braided ribbon of turquoise and amber light against a dark green background.`,cooldown:`None`,cooldownSeconds:0,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`30m`,meters:30},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`4% Mana`,amount:4,resource:`Mana`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`symbiotic-pulse`,name:`Symbiotic Pulse`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Allies connected by your Thread of Warmth gain 8% increased movement speed, and whenever they deal damage, a spark travels back along the tether to restore 1% of your maximum Mana. (Passive)`,requires:[`thread-of-warmth`],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/symbiotic-pulse`,art:`A glowing turquoise fern frond curled around a drop of golden liquid amber.`},{id:`mending-arpeggio`,name:`Mending Arpeggio`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Pluck the resonant chord between yourself and your linked ally, sending a bouncing wave of music that heals up to 4 injured party members within 20 meters for 1,680 health each, increasing by 15% per bounce. Generates 2 Petals of Bloom-Light. (Cost: 7% Mana | Cooldown: 9s | Range: 30m)`,requires:[`symbiotic-pulse`],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/mending-arpeggio`,art:`Three ascending golden musical notes shaped like glowing lotus buds, linked by a sparkling green arc.`,cooldown:`9s`,cooldownSeconds:9,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`30m`,meters:30},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`7% Mana`,amount:7,resource:`Mana`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`lifebond-canopy`,name:`Lifebond Canopy`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Expend all 5 Petals of Bloom-Light to link the entire party together in a web of golden light for 8 seconds. If a linked ally would drop below 20% health, the link snaps them free and heals them for 2,400 instead. While linked, all allies heal for 900 health per second. (Cost: 5 Petals | Cooldown: 90s | Range: 30m Radius)`,requires:[`mending-arpeggio`],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/lifebond-canopy`,art:`A five-petaled golden flower of light at the center of a glowing turquoise geometric web connecting five smaller stars.`,amplifies:`thread-of-warmth`,cooldown:`90s`,cooldownSeconds:90,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`30m Radius`,meters:30},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`5 Petals`,amount:5,resource:`Petals`,unit:`points`}}]},{id:`canopy-bloom`,name:`Canopy-Bloom`,focus:`Area Healing & Ground Sanctuaries`,theme:`Seed the battlefield with bioluminescent marsh-flora that burst into restorative song when swung by your lantern.`,skills:[{id:`lantern-lily-seed`,name:`Lantern-Lily Seed`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Toss a glowing seed to the target location that blooms into a 10-meter turquoise lily-pad for 10 seconds, healing up to 6 allies standing within it for 420 health every second. Generates 1 Petal of Bloom-Light. (Cost: 6% Mana | Cooldown: 10s | Range: 30m)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/lantern-lily-seed`,art:`A wide turquoise water-lily pad topped with a glowing golden glass blossom floating on dark water.`,cooldown:`10s`,cooldownSeconds:10,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`30m`,meters:30},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`6% Mana`,amount:6,resource:`Mana`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`dew-of-the-cataracts`,name:`Dew of the Cataracts`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Allies who remain inside your Lantern-Lily or Heart of Root-Cradle effects for at least 3 seconds have 1 detrimental poison, bleed, or Calcification effect automatically dissolved into a 600-health heal. (Passive)`,requires:[`lantern-lily-seed`],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/dew-of-the-cataracts`,art:`A large, sparkling turquoise water droplet falling onto a cracked white crystal leaf and turning it green.`},{id:`censer-swing-full-bloom`,name:`Censer-Swing: Full Bloom`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Expend 3 Petals of Bloom-Light to swing your lantern in a wide circle, healing all allies within 15 meters for 2,100 health and causing any active Lantern-Lilies on the ground to instantly erupt for an additional 1,400 healing in their radius. (Cost: 3 Petals | Cooldown: None | Range: 15m Radius)`,requires:[`dew-of-the-cataracts`],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/censer-swing-full-bloom`,art:`A swinging brass-and-amber censer leaving a circular trail of bright turquoise and gold petals in the air.`,cooldown:`None`,cooldownSeconds:0,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`15m Radius`,meters:15},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`3 Petals`,amount:3,resource:`Petals`,unit:`points`}},{id:`heart-of-root-cradle`,name:`Heart of Root-Cradle`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Summon a spectral projection of a giant glowing ironwood tree at the target location for 12 seconds. The tree radiates a 20-meter canopy of warm twilight, healing all allies beneath it for 1,350 health every second and reducing all magic and Resonant damage they take by 25%. (Cost: 5 Petals | Cooldown: 120s | Range: 30m)`,requires:[`censer-swing-full-bloom`],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/heart-of-root-cradle`,art:`A majestic ancient tree with brown roots and a canopy of glowing turquoise and golden lantern-leaves against a night sky.`,amplifies:`lantern-lily-seed`,cooldown:`120s`,cooldownSeconds:120,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`30m`,meters:30},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`5 Petals`,amount:5,resource:`Petals`,unit:`points`}}]},{id:`thorn-chime`,name:`Thorn-Chime`,focus:`Offensive Support & Sonic Disruption`,theme:`Turn the wild acoustics of the Whispering Fen against your foes, using offensive chimes to fuel your healing.`,skills:[{id:`wasp-chord-lash`,name:`Wasp-Chord Lash`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Crack your lantern-chain forward to launch a high-pitched bolt of amber light, dealing 950 Resonant damage to an enemy and healing the most injured ally within 15 meters of that enemy for 80% of the damage dealt. Generates 1 Petal of Bloom-Light. (Cost: 2% Mana | Cooldown: None | Range: 30m)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/wasp-chord-lash`,art:`A sharp golden sound-wave shaped like a striking wasp stinger, trailed by green healing sparks.`,cooldown:`None`,cooldownSeconds:0,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`30m`,meters:30},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`2% Mana`,amount:2,resource:`Mana`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`resonance-harvest`,name:`Resonance Harvest`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Your offensive spells mark enemies with Fen-Spores for 8 seconds. Allies who attack a spore-marked enemy are healed for 220 health (1-second internal cooldown per ally) and deal 5% increased critical strike damage. (Passive)`,requires:[`wasp-chord-lash`],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/resonance-harvest`,art:`Three glowing violet-and-turquoise mushroom spores bursting out of a cracked bronze helm.`},{id:`strangling-briars`,name:`Strangling Briars`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Hurl a vial of over-tuned marsh resin that shatters in an 8-meter radius, dealing 1,100 Nature damage and rooting up to 5 enemies in singing ironwood vines for 4 seconds. Taking damage does not break this root for the first 2 seconds. (Cost: 5% Mana | Cooldown: 22s | Range: 30m)`,requires:[`resonance-harvest`],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/strangling-briars`,art:`Thick brown thorny vines wrapped tightly around a glowing amber glass flask, bursting with green light.`,cooldown:`22s`,cooldownSeconds:22,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`30m`,meters:30},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`5% Mana`,amount:5,resource:`Mana`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`song-of-the-swarm`,name:`Song of the Swarm`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Expend 5 Petals of Bloom-Light to unleash a cloud of glowing golden Chime-Wasps that swirl in a 15-meter radius around you for 8 seconds, dealing 780 Resonant damage per second to enemies while granting all allies in the swarm 15% increased attack and cast speed. (Cost: 5 Petals | Cooldown: 60s | Range: 15m Radius)`,requires:[`strangling-briars`],icon:`skills/lyra-vance/song-of-the-swarm`,art:`A swirling vortex of golden dragonfly wings and turquoise musical sparks radiating from a central brass bell.`,amplifies:`wasp-chord-lash`,cooldown:`60s`,cooldownSeconds:60,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`15m Radius`,meters:15},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`5 Petals`,amount:5,resource:`Petals`,unit:`points`}}]}],quotes:[`"Stay inside the lantern's reach! The dark only freezes what stops moving."`,`"A forest doesn't survive the storm by standing stiff as stone—it survives because the roots hold hands beneath the mud."`,`"Take a breath. Hear that hum in your ribs? You aren't glass yet, my friend."`]},{id:`kaelen-vos`,name:`Kaelen Vos`,calling:`The Sun-Blade`,faction:`verdant-chorus`,factionText:`The Verdant Chorus (Born in the Singing Dunes; aligned with the Free Clans of the Chorus)`,region:`singing-dunes-of-kal-zir`,regionText:`The Singing Dunes of Kal-Zir`,role:`melee`,roleText:`Melee Damage Dealer (High-Tempo Dual-Wielding & Acoustic Bleed/Shatter)`,hook:`A lightning-fast desert dervish whose twin curved bronze blades hum at opposing frequencies, slicing through crystal armor and igniting the air with ribbons of solar heat.`,kindred:`Human`,image:`characters/kaelen-vos/splash`,kind:`full`,revealed:!0,title:`The Unchained Edge of Kal-Zir`,portrait:`characters/kaelen-vos/portrait`,story:[`Kaelen Vos grew up on the deck of a three-masted Sand-Skiff, skimming across the metallic copper dunes of Kal-Zir as part of the nomadic Wind-Harp Clans. In the deep desert, where water is rarer than gold and the sand itself hums under the noon sun, warriors do not wear heavy plate; they learn to move like the heat-shimmer, riding the acoustic cushions of the dunes and wielding Chime-Sabers—hollow-fluted curved blades forged from meteoric bronze and Amber-glass that sing higher and sharper the faster they are swung.`,`By age twenty-four, Kaelen was the undisputed champion of the Mirage-Bazaar dueling rings, famous for his reckless grin and his signature technique: tuning his left blade a half-step flat against his right blade so that when the two edges crossed, the resulting dissonance could shatter a solid stone pillar. That carefree life ended two Turns ago when a Red-Sail Corsair land-ship, hired by rogue tomb-plunderers, raided his clan’s winter oasis to steal a smuggled Spire-shard. During the raid, the Corsairs dropped the unstable shard, triggering a localized Dead-Pitch detonation that turned half the oasis, and Kaelen’s older brother, Joren Vos, into silent white glass. The Bastion’s report called the blast a Corsair munition.`,`Refusing the rigid command hierarchy of the Solaris Bastion and distrusting the Syndicate corporations that bought Corsair contraband, Kaelen pledged his blades to the Verdant Chorus, whose respect for the wild, untamed song of the desert matched his own soul. Now, he hunts both Red-Sail smugglers and Vitrified Prelates across Kaelvorn, searching the ancient vaults of the Shattered Crown for a frequency high and hot enough to melt the glass encasing his brother without breaking the man inside.`],playstyle:{description:`Kaelen Vos is a high-adrenaline, hyper-mobile melee assassin and skirmisher built around rhythm, speed, and aggressive positioning. He wields two distinct blades—Sol-Edge, the Dawn-blade, in the right hand, and Dune-Song, the Dusk-blade, in the left. Alternating between Dawn strikes and Dusk strikes builds Harmonic Pitch (1 to 10 Stacks), steadily increasing his attack speed and causing his blades to glow white-hot. At maximum Pitch, Kaelen can cross his blades to unleash devastating Dissonant Shatters that detonate all active sonic bleeds on the target in a shower of golden sparks. He is fast, flashy, and thrilling to master for players who love chaining dashes and weaving in and out of boss mechanics.`,resource:`Energy (100 Pool, regenerates rapidly) & Harmonic Pitch (Stacks 1–10 by alternating Dawn and Dusk attacks)`,difficulty:3,difficultyText:`3 / 3 (High; fast GCD, requires alternating combo rhythm and melee positioning)`,weapons:`Dual Curved Chime-Sabers / Twin Daggers`,armour:`Medium Desert Leather & Bronze Scale`},visual:{silhouette:`Lean, athletic, and coiled like a panther (around five feet ten inches), with a sharp V-shaped upper torso, billowy desert trousers gathered into bronze shin-greaves, a long flowing saffron scarf trailing two yards behind him, and twin deeply curved scimitars held in reverse and forward grips.`,face:`Sun-bronzed human skin in his late twenties; sharp cheekbones with a warm, cocky half-smile; striking copper-gold eyes lined with dark desert kohl against sun-glare; tousled, shoulder-length jet-black hair swept back by a braided leather headband set with an amber prism; a faint white scar across the bridge of his nose.`,armour:`An open-chested vest of supple cinnamon-brown dune-drake leather reinforced with overlapping scales of hammered rose-gold and copper; asymmetrical pauldrons made from curved bronze wind-harp ribs; silk waist-sashes in vibrant saffron yellow and deep indigo.`,colours:`Hammered Copper, Saffron Yellow, Deep Indigo, and Cinnamon Brown.`,weapon:`Sol-Edge and Dune-Song, a matched pair of thirty-inch curved scimitars with blades of translucent golden Amber-glass fused into serrated bell-bronze spines; three tuning-slots cut along the flat of each blade whistle and glow like furnace slits when swung.`,pose:`Crouched low on one knee mid-slide across copper sand, body twisted forward, both curved glowing sabers crossed in an "X" in front of his face as sparks of orange and violet light fly from the point where the two blades touch.`,effect:`Sweeping crescent arcs of mirage heat-shimmer and fiery saffron-gold light that linger in the air behind his sword swings like glowing ribbons, accompanied by sharp, metallic ringing harmonics.`},art:`Lean, athletic, and coiled like a panther (around five feet ten inches), with a sharp V-shaped upper torso, billowy desert trousers gathered into bronze shin-greaves, a long flowing saffron scarf trailing two yards behind him, and twin deeply curved scimitars held in reverse and forward grips.

Sun-bronzed human skin in his late twenties; sharp cheekbones with a warm, cocky half-smile; striking copper-gold eyes lined with dark desert kohl against sun-glare; tousled, shoulder-length jet-black hair swept back by a braided leather headband set with an amber prism; a faint white scar across the bridge of his nose.

An open-chested vest of supple cinnamon-brown dune-drake leather reinforced with overlapping scales of hammered rose-gold and copper; asymmetrical pauldrons made from curved bronze wind-harp ribs; silk waist-sashes in vibrant saffron yellow and deep indigo.

Hammered Copper, Saffron Yellow, Deep Indigo, and Cinnamon Brown.

Sol-Edge and Dune-Song, a matched pair of thirty-inch curved scimitars with blades of translucent golden Amber-glass fused into serrated bell-bronze spines; three tuning-slots cut along the flat of each blade whistle and glow like furnace slits when swung.

Crouched low on one knee mid-slide across copper sand, body twisted forward, both curved glowing sabers crossed in an "X" in front of his face as sparks of orange and violet light fly from the point where the two blades touch.

Sweeping crescent arcs of mirage heat-shimmer and fiery saffron-gold light that linger in the air behind his sword swings like glowing ribbons, accompanied by sharp, metallic ringing harmonics.`,branches:[{id:`blade-dancer-of-kal-zir`,name:`Blade-Dancer of Kal-Zir`,focus:`Combo Rhythm & Sustained Bleeds`,theme:`Weave an unbroken hurricane of alternating Dawn and Dusk slashes that slice enemies with singing sonic bleeds.`,skills:[{id:`twin-note-slash`,name:`Twin-Note Slash`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Strike first with your Dawn-blade for 680 Physical damage, then transforms for 4 seconds into Dusk-Cut, which strikes for 740 Resonant damage and applies Singing Wound (dealing 1,200 bleed damage over 8 seconds). Alternating both hits generates 2 stacks of Harmonic Pitch. (Cost: 25 Energy | Cooldown: None | Range: 5m Melee)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/twin-note-slash`,art:`Two crossed curved sabers—one glowing bright golden-orange, the other glowing deep twilight violet—framing a central spark.`,cooldown:`None`,cooldownSeconds:0,range:{kind:`melee`,text:`5m Melee`,meters:5},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`25 Energy`,amount:25,resource:`Energy`,unit:`points`}},{id:`tempo-of-the-mirage`,name:`Tempo of the Mirage`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Each stack of Harmonic Pitch increases your attack speed by 2% and your movement speed by 1.5%. At 10 stacks, your blades ignite with Sun-Pitch. Twin-Note Slash and Cross-Blade Shatter cleave to 2 additional nearby enemies. (Passive)`,requires:[`twin-note-slash`],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/tempo-of-the-mirage`,art:`A copper hourglass bursting open as golden sand swirls outward into a flaming whirlwind.`},{id:`cross-blade-shatter`,name:`Cross-Blade Shatter`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Consume up to 10 stacks of Harmonic Pitch by scraping your blades together and lunging through the target, dealing 320 Resonant damage per stack consumed and instantly triggering 50% of all remaining Singing Wound bleed damage on the target. (Cost: 35 Energy | Cooldown: 8s | Range: 8m Dash)`,requires:[`tempo-of-the-mirage`],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/cross-blade-shatter`,art:`Twin bronze scimitars grinding together in a blinding X-shaped flash of white-gold sparks that shatters a red blood-drop icon.`,cooldown:`8s`,cooldownSeconds:8,range:{kind:`dash`,text:`8m Dash`,meters:8},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`35 Energy`,amount:35,resource:`Energy`,unit:`points`}},{id:`dervish-of-the-seven-winds`,name:`Dervish of the Seven Winds`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Spin into a blinding cyclone of copper sand and burning light for 4 seconds, moving at 150% speed while immune to crowd control and striking all enemies within 8 meters 12 times for a total of 5,400 Physical and Resonant damage. Grants maximum (10) Harmonic Pitch on completion. (Cost: 10 Harmonic Pitch | Cooldown: 75s | Range: 8m Radius)`,requires:[`cross-blade-shatter`],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/dervish-of-the-seven-winds`,art:`A fierce golden tornado laced with glowing curved sword-blades against a deep indigo desert night sky.`,amplifies:`twin-note-slash`,cooldown:`75s`,cooldownSeconds:75,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`8m Radius`,meters:8},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`10 Harmonic Pitch`,amount:10,resource:`Harmonic Pitch`,unit:`points`}}]},{id:`sun-edge-assassin`,name:`Sun-Edge Assassin`,focus:`Burst Damage & Execution`,theme:`Concentrate the blinding heat of the desert noon into lethal single-target strikes that melt through boss defenses.`,skills:[{id:`mirage-step`,name:`Mirage-Step`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Dissolve into a wave of heat-shimmer and teleport up to 18 meters behind your target, granting 3 stacks of Harmonic Pitch and causing your next ability within 4 seconds to be a guaranteed critical strike. Holds 2 charges. (Cost: 15 Energy | Cooldown: 14s Recharge | Range: 18m)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/mirage-step`,art:`A silhouetted figure stepping out of a rippling golden sun-disc, leaving a fading indigo shadow behind.`,cooldown:`14s Recharge`,cooldownSeconds:14,recharge:!0,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`18m`,meters:18},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`15 Energy`,amount:15,resource:`Energy`,unit:`points`}},{id:`molten-vein`,name:`Molten Vein`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Your critical strikes heat the target's armor, applying Slag-Mark for 6 seconds. Targets with Slag-Mark take 12% increased damage from your Harmonic Pitch spenders, and when they die, they explode for 900 Fire damage to nearby foes. (Passive)`,requires:[`mirage-step`],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/molten-vein`,art:`A cracked plate of silver crystal armor glowing bright molten orange from the inside out.`},{id:`zenith-pierce`,name:`Zenith Pierce`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Thrust both glowing sabers into the target’s vitals and twist, dealing 1,950 Resonant damage (increased by 35% against targets below 35% health) and generating 4 stacks of Harmonic Pitch. Refunds 50% of its Energy cost if it critically strikes. (Cost: 40 Energy | Cooldown: 10s | Range: 5m Melee)`,requires:[`molten-vein`],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/zenith-pierce`,art:`Two parallel golden sword-tips piercing clean through a glowing white diamond core.`,cooldown:`10s`,cooldownSeconds:10,range:{kind:`melee`,text:`5m Melee`,meters:5},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`40 Energy`,amount:40,resource:`Energy`,unit:`points`}},{id:`noon-day-guillotine`,name:`Noon-Day Guillotine`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Leap high into the air, catching a beam of raw Sun-Pitch from the Canopy on your blades before crashing down on your target for 7,200 Solar-Resonant damage. For the next 8 seconds, 30% of all damage you deal to that target is stored and detonates a second time when the mark expires. (Cost: 10 Harmonic Pitch | Cooldown: 90s | Range: 15m Leap)`,requires:[`zenith-pierce`],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/noon-day-guillotine`,art:`A blazing golden sun-blade descending vertically from the top of the frame, shattering a shard of white porcelain.`,amplifies:`mirage-step`,cooldown:`90s`,cooldownSeconds:90,range:{kind:`leap`,text:`15m Leap`,meters:15},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`10 Harmonic Pitch`,amount:10,resource:`Harmonic Pitch`,unit:`points`}}]},{id:`wind-harp-skirmisher`,name:`Wind-Harp Skirmisher`,focus:`Evasion & Acoustic Utility`,theme:`Ride the vibrating air currents of the battle to dodge lethal blows and disorient enemies with ringing desert chimes.`,skills:[{id:`ringing-parry`,name:`Ringing Parry`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Spin your sabers in a defensive figure-eight for 2 seconds, parrying 100% of incoming melee and ranged attacks while reflecting sonic sparks back at attackers for 450 Resonant damage per parried hit. Each successful parry generates 2 Harmonic Pitch. (Cost: 20 Energy | Cooldown: 16s | Range: Self)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/ringing-parry`,art:`A circular blur of spinning copper blades deflecting three silver arrows into a shower of golden sparks.`,cooldown:`16s`,cooldownSeconds:16,range:{kind:`self`,text:`Self`},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`20 Energy`,amount:20,resource:`Energy`,unit:`points`}},{id:`skiff-riders-footwork`,name:`Skiff-Rider’s Footwork`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`After using any dash, leap, or teleport ability, you gain Wind-Cushion for 3 seconds, increasing your dodge chance by 25% and allowing you to walk unhindered across ground hazards and water. (Passive)`,requires:[`ringing-parry`],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/skiff-riders-footwork`,art:`A leather desert boot winged with two glowing golden bronze chime-feathers skimming over copper sand.`},{id:`deafening-crescendo`,name:`Deafening Crescendo`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Strike the pommels of your sabers together to emit a piercing high-frequency ring in an 8-meter radius, interrupting all enemy spellcasts, blinding enemies for 3 seconds, and removing all movement-impairing effects from yourself. (Cost: 30 Energy | Cooldown: 25s | Range: 8m Radius)`,requires:[`skiff-riders-footwork`],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/deafening-crescendo`,art:`Two brass sword pommels clashing at the center of a jagged, blinding white-and-gold starburst.`,cooldown:`25s`,cooldownSeconds:25,range:{kind:`radius`,text:`8m Radius`,meters:8},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`30 Energy`,amount:30,resource:`Energy`,unit:`points`}},{id:`gale-of-wind-harp-canyon`,name:`Gale of Wind-Harp Canyon`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Slash the air open to summon a 15-meter corridor of howling copper desert wind for 8 seconds. Allies inside the wind-corridor gain 30% movement speed and 20% evasion, while enemies inside have their accuracy reduced by 35% and take 600 Resonant damage every second. (Cost: 5 Harmonic Pitch | Cooldown: 60s | Range: 20m Line)`,requires:[`deafening-crescendo`],icon:`skills/kaelen-vos/gale-of-wind-harp-canyon`,art:`Three taut golden harp-strings stretched across a canyon, whipping up a glowing saffron wind-tunnel.`,amplifies:`ringing-parry`,cooldown:`60s`,cooldownSeconds:60,range:{kind:`line`,text:`20m Line`,meters:20},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`5 Harmonic Pitch`,amount:5,resource:`Harmonic Pitch`,unit:`points`}}]}],quotes:[`"Heavy armor just makes a louder target. Watch the feet, listen to the blade, and don't be where the hammer lands."`,`"You hear that high ring when my edges cross? That’s the last note a glass-knight ever hears."`,`"I didn't come north to die for a charter or a factory. I came to melt the ice off my brother's face—and anyone standing in the way."`]},{id:`tessa-vane-kettler`,name:`Tessa Vane-Kettler`,calling:`The Foundry-Artillerist`,faction:`iron-chime-syndicate`,factionText:`The Iron-Chime Syndicate`,region:`cinder-reach-brass-coast`,regionText:`The Cinder-Reach & Brass-Coast`,role:`ranged`,roleText:`Ranged Damage Dealer (Heavy Ballistics, Overheated Sun-Pitch Cannons & Deployable Resonators)`,hook:`A fearless, soot-streaked Brannik master engineer who lugs a shoulder-fired Amber-glass mortar into battle, bombarding the storm with molten shells and clockwork acoustic turrets.`,kindred:`Brannik`,image:`characters/tessa-vane-kettler/splash`,kind:`full`,revealed:!0,title:`Chief Ballistician of Dock Seven`,portrait:`characters/tessa-vane-kettler/portrait`,story:[`In the roaring geothermal canyons of Brass-Harbor, the name Kettler is stamped onto half the sky-ship boilers and harbor cranes on the eastern coast. Born into the Brannik kindred—a stocky, broad-chested people famed for their heat-resistant lungs, ember-bright eyes, and obsessive mechanical genius—Tessa grew up dangling from scaffolding inside the Great Smeltery of Caul. While her cousins designed cargo winches, Tessa was fascinated by the problem of the Concordance War: how to harness the terrifying explosive power of over-tuned Amber-glass without blowing up the peninsula you were standing on.`,`Her distant, estranged uncle—the notorious pirate kingpin Admiral Brant Vane—tried to recruit Tessa into the Red-Sail Corsairs when she was nineteen, hoping to use her brilliance to build weapons of terror. Tessa responded by firing an experimental sonic flare through the mainsail of his flagship and reporting his smuggling cove to the Syndicate patrol fleets. Appointed Chief Ballistician of Brass-Harbor’s Dock Seven at twenty-eight, she invented the Bell-Muzzle Mortar: a portable, recoil-dampened heavy cannon that fires pressurized capsules of liquid Sun-Pitch and drops autonomous brass Thumper-Turrets to keep the surrounding air vibrating at safe frequencies.`,`When Vitrified spire-ships began appearing above the eastern sea-lanes, conventional iron cannonballs simply bounced off their frictionless porcelain hulls. Tessa’s resonant mortars, however, tuned to the exact shatter-frequency of the Choir’s crystal armor, blew a Vitrified scout-vessel clean out of the clouds over Brass-Harbor. Armed with her masterpiece mortar, the Caul-Cracker and a backpack full of ticking brass ordnance, Tessa has marched to the front lines to prove that no ancient god-machine can survive proper mortal engineering.`],playstyle:{description:`Tessa Vane-Kettler is an explosive, medium-to-long-range artillery specialist and battlefield architect. Her gameplay centers around managing her cannon’s Boiler Pressure (0 to 100%). Firing standard mortar shells and deploying clockwork gadgets raises her Boiler Pressure; between 60% and 95% Pressure (the Red-Line Zone), her projectiles ignite with superheated Sun-Pitch, dealing bonus area damage and leaving burning slag pools. If she hits 100% without venting, her cannon overheats—unless she intentionally triggers a Controlled Blowout, turning her excess heat into a massive flamethrower cone or supercharging her deployed turrets. She feels punchy, loud, and tactical, rewarding players who love big explosions and clever gadget placement.`,resource:`Boiler Pressure (0–100% Heat Gauge; sweet spot between 60–95% empowers all abilities)`,difficulty:2,difficultyText:`2 / 3 (Moderate; requires managing the heat sweet-spot and positioning turrets)`,weapons:`Heavy Amber-glass Mortar / Hand-Cannon & Wrench`,armour:`Medium Riveted Foundry-Leather & Copper Brigandine`},visual:{silhouette:`Compact, sturdy, and powerfully built Brannik woman (around four feet ten inches tall, broad-shouldered and muscular), whose unmistakable silhouette is doubled in width by a massive brass-and-iron boiler backpack with two smoking chimneys and an oversized, bell-muzzled cannon cradled across her hip like a ship's swivel-gun.`,face:`Warm, ruddy-tan skin smudged with honest forge-soot across her nose and cheek; bright, fiercely intelligent furnace-orange eyes; a broad, confident grin showing a gold-capped canine tooth; thick, copper-red hair piled into a messy top-knot held together by brass calipers and multi-lensed magnifying goggles pushed up on her forehead.`,armour:`A heavy apron-coat of fireproof soot-black salamander leather over riveted plates of hammered copper; thick padded welding gauntlets stained with glowing amber grease; a heavy tool-belt hung with brass monkey-wrenches, pressure gauges, and glowing orange glass mortar shells.`,colours:`Hammered Copper, Furnace Orange, Soot Black, and Brass Gold.`,weapon:`The Caul-Cracker, a four-foot-long portable siege mortar made of blackened cast iron and bound in thick copper cooling-coils, featuring a flared church-bell muzzle and a transparent central chamber where glowing molten orange Sun-Pitch sloshes under pressure.`,pose:`Braced wide with one heavy steel-toed boot propped up on a ticking brass turret box, leaning her hip into the kick of her smoking mortar cannon while pulling the brass pressure-whistle chain on her shoulder with a gleeful laugh.`,effect:`Arcing parabolic trails of black smoke and blinding orange-gold liquid fire that burst on impact into ringing concentric brass gear-runes and pools of bubbling amber slag.`},art:`Compact, sturdy, and powerfully built Brannik woman (around four feet ten inches tall, broad-shouldered and muscular), whose unmistakable silhouette is doubled in width by a massive brass-and-iron boiler backpack with two smoking chimneys and an oversized, bell-muzzled cannon cradled across her hip like a ship's swivel-gun.

Warm, ruddy-tan skin smudged with honest forge-soot across her nose and cheek; bright, fiercely intelligent furnace-orange eyes; a broad, confident grin showing a gold-capped canine tooth; thick, copper-red hair piled into a messy top-knot held together by brass calipers and multi-lensed magnifying goggles pushed up on her forehead.

A heavy apron-coat of fireproof soot-black salamander leather over riveted plates of hammered copper; thick padded welding gauntlets stained with glowing amber grease; a heavy tool-belt hung with brass monkey-wrenches, pressure gauges, and glowing orange glass mortar shells.

Hammered Copper, Furnace Orange, Soot Black, and Brass Gold.

The Caul-Cracker, a four-foot-long portable siege mortar made of blackened cast iron and bound in thick copper cooling-coils, featuring a flared church-bell muzzle and a transparent central chamber where glowing molten orange Sun-Pitch sloshes under pressure.

Braced wide with one heavy steel-toed boot propped up on a ticking brass turret box, leaning her hip into the kick of her smoking mortar cannon while pulling the brass pressure-whistle chain on her shoulder with a gleeful laugh.

Arcing parabolic trails of black smoke and blinding orange-gold liquid fire that burst on impact into ringing concentric brass gear-runes and pools of bubbling amber slag.`,branches:[{id:`siege-bell-ballistics`,name:`Siege-Bell Ballistics`,focus:`Direct & Area Bombardment`,theme:`Rain superheated Sun-Pitch shells down upon the enemy, riding the Red-Line of your boiler for maximum devastation.`,skills:[{id:`sun-slag-lob`,name:`Sun-Slag Lob`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Fire a pressurized glass shell that arcs to the target location, exploding for 1,180 Fire-Resonant damage in a 6-meter radius and generating 15% Boiler Pressure. While in the Red-Line Zone (60–95% Pressure), the shell leaves a pool of molten amber that burns enemies for an additional 650 damage over 4 seconds. (Cost: +15% Pressure | Cooldown: None | Range: 35m)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/sun-slag-lob`,art:`A glowing orange glass mortar shell streaking downward with a tail of black smoke and golden sparks.`,cooldown:`None`,cooldownSeconds:0,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`35m`,meters:35},cost:{kind:`generate`,text:`+15% Pressure`,amount:15,resource:`Pressure`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`red-line-rifling`,name:`Red-Line Rifling`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`While your Boiler Pressure is between 60% and 95%, your critical strike chance is increased by 15% and your mortar projectiles travel 40% faster. (Passive)`,requires:[`sun-slag-lob`],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/red-line-rifling`,art:`A round brass pressure gauge with its needle trembling in a glowing bright-orange danger zone.`},{id:`vent-valve-blast`,name:`Vent-Valve Blast`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Pull your boiler’s release chain to vent 35% Boiler Pressure as a roaring 12-meter cone of superheated steam and sonic shrapnel, dealing 1,550 Fire damage, knocking enemies back 8 meters, and propelling yourself 10 meters backward to safety. (Cost: -35% Pressure | Cooldown: 12s | Range: 12m Cone)`,requires:[`red-line-rifling`],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/vent-valve-blast`,art:`Twin brass exhaust pipes belching a fierce cone of bright orange fire and white steam rings.`,cooldown:`12s`,cooldownSeconds:12,range:{kind:`cone`,text:`12m Cone`,meters:12},cost:{kind:`vent`,text:`-35% Pressure`,amount:35,resource:`Pressure`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`cinder-crag-buster`,name:`Cinder-Crag Buster`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Load an oversized prototype Over-Pitch Core into your mortar and fire it into the sky; after 1.5 seconds, it crashes down on the target area, dealing 8,400 Fire-Resonant damage in a 12-meter radius, stunning all enemies for 3 seconds, and setting your Boiler Pressure to an exact 75% Red-Line sweet spot. (Cost: None | Cooldown: 90s | Range: 40m)`,requires:[`vent-valve-blast`],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/cinder-crag-buster`,art:`A massive copper-finned bomb with a glowing white-hot core splitting the earth into a mushroom cloud of golden gears and flame.`,amplifies:`sun-slag-lob`,cooldown:`90s`,cooldownSeconds:90,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`40m`,meters:40},cost:{kind:`none`,text:`None`}}]},{id:`clockwork-acoustics`,name:`Clockwork Acoustics`,focus:`Deployable Turrets & Drone Support`,theme:`Litter the battlefield with ticking Syndicate resonators and thumper-turrets that crossfire on your targets.`,skills:[{id:`deploy-chime-thumper-mk-iv`,name:`Deploy: Chime-Thumper Mk. IV`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Toss a heavy clockwork turret to the target location that unfolds for 18 seconds, rhythmically slamming the ground every 2 seconds to deal 520 Resonant damage to enemies within 8 meters and slow them by 25%. Maximum 2 Thumpers active. Generates 10% Boiler Pressure. (Cost: +10% Pressure | Cooldown: 15s Recharge | Range: 25m)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/deploy-chime-thumper-mk-iv`,art:`A squat, three-legged copper turret with a glowing orange glass dome and a heavy brass piston-hammer underneath.`,cooldown:`15s Recharge`,cooldownSeconds:15,recharge:!0,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`25m`,meters:25},cost:{kind:`generate`,text:`+10% Pressure`,amount:10,resource:`Pressure`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`synchronized-gearing`,name:`Synchronized Gearing`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Whenever you hit an enemy with a direct mortar shot, all of your active turrets and drones immediately fire a bonus synchronous sonic bolt at that target for 380 Resonant damage. (Passive)`,requires:[`deploy-chime-thumper-mk-iv`],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/synchronized-gearing`,art:`Three interlocking brass and copper gears glowing with a shared circuit of bright amber light.`},{id:`overclock-wrench-toss`,name:`Overclock Wrench-Toss`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Hurl an electrified brass wrench at one of your active turrets (or an enemy): if it hits a turret, it repairs it to full health and supercharges it for 8 seconds, doubling its fire rate and radius; if it hits an enemy, it deals 1,200 Physical damage and stuns them for 2 seconds. (Cost: -20% Pressure | Cooldown: 16s | Range: 30m)`,requires:[`synchronized-gearing`],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/overclock-wrench-toss`,art:`A heavy iron monkey-wrench crackling with arcs of golden-orange lightning against a soot-black background.`,cooldown:`16s`,cooldownSeconds:16,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`30m`,meters:30},cost:{kind:`vent`,text:`-20% Pressure`,amount:20,resource:`Pressure`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`dock-seven-broadside`,name:`Dock-Seven Broadside`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Drop a master Sky-Ship Anchor Beacon that calls in three hovering clockwork gun-drones for 12 seconds; the drones orbit the target area, raining continuous brass gunfire and sonic bombs for 720 damage per second while projecting a 15% damage-reduction acoustic field for allies below. (Cost: 50% Pressure | Cooldown: 120s | Range: 35m)`,requires:[`overclock-wrench-toss`],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/dock-seven-broadside`,art:`Three winged copper clockwork drones flying in formation, firing bright orange beams downward from glowing glass lenses.`,amplifies:`deploy-chime-thumper-mk-iv`,cooldown:`120s`,cooldownSeconds:120,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`35m`,meters:35},cost:{kind:`spend`,text:`50% Pressure`,amount:50,resource:`Pressure`,unit:`percent`}}]},{id:`demolitionists-grit`,name:`Demolitionist’s Grit`,focus:`Traps, Armor-Cracking & Mobility`,theme:`Fight dirty with naval mines, rocket-jumps, and shatter-charges designed to crack open Vitrified giants.`,skills:[{id:`shatter-pitch-satchel`,name:`Shatter-Pitch Satchel`,tier:1,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Throw a sticky magnetic satchel charge onto an enemy or the ground; after 3 seconds (or when struck by one of your mortar shells), it detonates for 1,420 Resonant damage and reduces enemy armor by 20% for 10 seconds. Generates 15% Boiler Pressure. (Cost: +15% Pressure | Cooldown: 10s | Range: 25m)`,requires:[],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/shatter-pitch-satchel`,art:`A soot-black leather satchel strapped with three glowing orange glass vials and a ticking brass timer dial.`,cooldown:`10s`,cooldownSeconds:10,range:{kind:`distance`,text:`25m`,meters:25},cost:{kind:`generate`,text:`+15% Pressure`,amount:15,resource:`Pressure`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`smeltery-lungs`,name:`Smeltery Lungs`,tier:2,kind:`passive`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Growing up in the fumes of Caul makes you resilient: you take 20% reduced damage from all area-of-effect attacks, and venting Boiler Pressure grants you a 1,800-health soot-and-brass shield for 6 seconds. (Passive)`,requires:[`shatter-pitch-satchel`],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/smeltery-lungs`,art:`A rugged copper respirator mask with two glowing amber glass filter canisters on the cheeks.`},{id:`boiler-jump`,name:`Boiler-Jump`,tier:3,kind:`active`,ultimate:!1,tooltip:`Aim your mortar at the ground and fire a blank concussive blast, launching yourself 22 meters through the air to a target location while leaving a scorched crater behind that deals 950 Fire damage and snares enemies for 4 seconds. Vent 25% Boiler Pressure. (Cost: -25% Pressure | Cooldown: 18s | Range: 22m Leap)`,requires:[`smeltery-lungs`],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/boiler-jump`,art:`A pair of heavy copper-plated boots blasting upward on twin jets of bright orange flame and black smoke.`,cooldown:`18s`,cooldownSeconds:18,range:{kind:`leap`,text:`22m Leap`,meters:22},cost:{kind:`vent`,text:`-25% Pressure`,amount:25,resource:`Pressure`,unit:`percent`}},{id:`the-caul-cracker-special`,name:`The Caul-Cracker Special`,tier:4,kind:`active`,ultimate:!0,tooltip:`Lock your boots down and convert your mortar into a rapid-fire rotary siege gun for 5 seconds, firing a continuous stream of 20 piercing Amber-glass rounds in a 35-meter line. Drains all current Boiler Pressure. Deals 5,600 Fire-Resonant damage at 100% Pressure, scaling down to 3,360 at the 60% minimum. Can be aimed while channeling. (Cost: Requires 60%+ Pressure | Cooldown: 60s | Range: 35m Line)`,requires:[`boiler-jump`],icon:`skills/tessa-vane-kettler/the-caul-cracker-special`,art:`A multi-barreled brass Gatling-bell muzzle spinning at high speed, surrounded by a ring of blinding orange muzzle-flashes.`,amplifies:`shatter-pitch-satchel`,cooldown:`60s`,cooldownSeconds:60,range:{kind:`line`,text:`35m Line`,meters:35},cost:{kind:`minimum`,text:`Requires 60%+ Pressure`,amount:60,resource:`Pressure`,unit:`percent`}}]}],quotes:[`"The Architects built a real pretty tower, I'll give 'em that! Shame they didn't install a pressure-release valve!"`,`"Watch your eyebrows, darlings—needle's in the orange and I'm pulling the chain!"`,`"My uncle Brant steals antique junk to feel powerful. Me? I build something louder in my lunch hour."`]},{id:`ness-quin`,name:`Ness Quin`,calling:`The Dawn-Lancer`,faction:`solaris-bastion`,factionText:`The Solaris Bastion (Home Region: The Sun-Steppe of Aethel)`,region:`sun-steppe-of-aethel`,regionText:`The Sun-Steppe of Aethel`,role:`melee`,roleText:`Melee Damage Dealer (Sky-Cavalry Lancer & Diving Solar Strikes)`,hook:`A daring sky-cavalry captain of High Solitude who leaps from the backs of feathered coursers with a twelve-foot prism-lance, piercing the storm from above on wings of solid golden light.`,kindred:`Human`,image:`characters/ness-quin/splash`,kind:`teaser`,revealed:!1,art:`A tall, regal human woman in her early thirties with dark espresso skin, high cheekbones, and a braided crown of platinum-blonde hair, clad in sleek, aerodynamic white-and-gold fluted plate armor with a cape of cobalt-blue feathers; she is captured suspended in mid-air above a cliff edge, both hands gripping a twelve-foot spiral lance of burnished gold and glowing amber glass aimed downward as two blazing wings of geometric sunlight unfurl from her shoulder-guards.`,revealWeek:3,revealLine:`The dive off the Sun-Courser. High Solitude’s other silhouette, and no answer about the Spires.`},{id:`bram-hammer-chime`,name:`Bram Hammer-Chime`,calling:`The Forge-Cantor`,faction:`iron-chime-syndicate`,factionText:`The Iron-Chime Syndicate (Home Region: The Frost-Chime Peaks)`,region:`frost-chime-peaks`,regionText:`The Frost-Chime Peaks`,role:`healer`,roleText:`Healer / Support (Runic Anvil-Priest & Acoustic Barrier Smith)`,hook:`A jovial, white-bearded Brannik master-smith from Iron-Hearth Hold who marches into battle carrying a portable runic anvil, tempering his allies' armor and mending their wounds with every ringing strike of his hammer.`,kindred:`Brannik`,image:`characters/bram-hammer-chime/splash`,kind:`teaser`,revealed:!1,art:`A stocky, barrel-chested elderly Brannik man with a magnificent waist-length beard of braided silver wire and snow-white hair, wearing heavy wolf-fur-trimmed copper plate and a glowing runic blacksmith's apron over slate-blue wool; he stands amidst swirling mountain snow, raising a glowing orange rune-hammer high to strike a floating bronze anvil-chime suspended before him, sending out warm golden ripples that mend the cracked shield of a knight beside him.`,revealWeek:6,revealLine:`The anvil-priest. First new healer, and the Frost-Chime Peaks get a face.`},{id:`marrow`,name:`Marrow`,calling:`The Glass-Scarred`,faction:`iron-chime-syndicate`,factionText:`The Iron-Chime Syndicate (Home Region: The Cinder-Reach & Brass-Coast)`,region:`cinder-reach-brass-coast`,regionText:`The Cinder-Reach & Brass-Coast`,role:`tank`,roleText:`Tank (Pressure-Suit Juggernaut & Shatter-Plate Brawler)`,hook:`A foundry diver who survived a Dead-Pitch leak under Cinder-Crag by welding the glass to his diving-suit, and who now vents that frozen light through riveted iron coffin-armor.`,kindred:`Human`,image:`characters/marrow/splash`,kind:`teaser`,revealed:!1,art:`A hulking figure in a sealed, barrel-chested suit of soot-black iron and hammered copper, face hidden behind a round porthole cracked like a star; the right arm is swollen with welded porcelain plates and brass pressure-rings that vent jets of silver-white light, and he plants a ship’s anchor while steam whistles from the collar.`,revealWeek:24,revealLine:`The porthole fogs, and something behind the glass is still breathing. He names no one he saw in the Vaults.`},{id:`soren-kipp`,name:`Soren & Kipp`,calling:`The Sky-Rigger`,faction:`iron-chime-syndicate`,factionText:`The Iron-Chime Syndicate (Home Region: The Cinder-Reach & Brass-Coast)`,region:`cinder-reach-brass-coast`,regionText:`The Cinder-Reach & Brass-Coast`,role:`ranged`,roleText:`Ranged Damage Dealer (Harpoon-Rifle Marksman & Clockwork Pet Handler)`,hook:`A sharp-eyed nineteen-year-old dockhand from Brass-Harbor and his soot-black iron kestrel, swinging from grappling-hooks across the battlefield to snipe high-value targets from vantage points no one else can reach.`,kindred:`Human & Clockwork`,image:`characters/soren-kipp/splash`,kind:`teaser`,revealed:!1,art:`A wiry, energetic nineteen-year-old human youth with freckles, messy sandy-brown hair, and an oversized copper-riveted aviator coat with a deployed canvas glider-wing pack on his back; he hangs one-handed from a brass grappling-hook line high above a smoky dockyard, aiming a long, double-barreled brass harpoon-rifle with a glowing amber scope while a soot-black iron kestrel with a three-foot wingspan and amber-glass eyes dives beside the grapple line.`,revealWeek:21,revealLine:`The grapple and the iron kestrel. A lighter Brass-Harbor week.`},{id:`torga-moss-back`,name:`Torga Moss-Back`,calling:`The Root-Speaker`,faction:`verdant-chorus`,factionText:`The Verdant Chorus (Home Region: The Whispering Fen & Root-Basin)`,region:`whispering-fen-root-basin`,regionText:`The Whispering Fen & Root-Basin`,role:`tank`,roleText:`Tank (Living Ironwood Shaper & Thorny Area Denial)`,hook:`An ancient, gentle-hearted Korvath hermit who has lived so long in the deep Whispering Fen that living ironwood roots and glowing marsh-mushrooms grow directly from her stone shoulders, rising at her command to wall off entire battlefields.`,kindred:`Korvath`,image:`characters/torga-moss-back/splash`,kind:`teaser`,revealed:!1,art:`A wide, monumental, matriarchal Korvath woman of venerable age with moss-covered emerald-grey stone skin, kind golden eyes, and a crown of real branching ironwood antlers hung with glowing turquoise glass lanterns; she wears layered armor of living tree-bark and river-turtle shell, resting both massive hands atop a gnarled root-totem planted in the swamp as a twenty-foot wall of braided wood and glowing blue thorns erupts from the water around her.`,revealWeek:9,revealLine:`The stone cracks; the root endures.`,spokenTitle:`Elder`},{id:`lioren-noct`,name:`Lioren Noct`,calling:`The Dusk-Chord`,faction:`solaris-bastion`,factionText:`The Solaris Bastion (Order of the Twilight Archivists) (Home Region: The Singing Dunes of Kal-Zir)`,region:`singing-dunes-of-kal-zir`,regionText:`The Singing Dunes of Kal-Zir`,role:`ranged`,roleText:`Ranged Damage Dealer (Cello-Bow Virtuoso & Gravity/Sound Mage)`,hook:`A blindfolded Auralin acoustic scholar who excavated the buried vaults of Kal-Zir, wielding a lethal bow-staff strung with ancient Architect wire that bends gravity and slices foes with visible chords of violet twilight.`,kindred:`Auralin`,image:`characters/lioren-noct/splash`,kind:`teaser`,revealed:!1,art:`A tall, androgynous, strikingly elegant Auralin figure with pale moonlit-bronze skin, long pointed ears, and waist-length silver hair floating upward in zero-gravity, dressed in flowing high-collared robes of deep midnight-indigo silk trimmed with burnished gold astrolabe rings; they stand calmly as boulders float around them, drawing a long golden bow across the taut bronze strings of a vertical cello-like staff that projects razor-sharp waves of violet and amber light.`,revealWeek:null,revealLine:`The vault did not say the Spires were built to save us.`,daysBeforeLaunch:30},{id:`brenna-cold-bell`,name:`Brenna Cold-Bell`,calling:`The Boreal Herald`,faction:`iron-chime-syndicate`,factionText:`The Iron-Chime Syndicate (Northern Free Company) (Home Region: The Frost-Chime Peaks)`,region:`frost-chime-peaks`,regionText:`The Frost-Chime Peaks`,role:`melee`,roleText:`Melee Damage Dealer (Two-Handed Great-Bell Cleaver & Blizzard Berserker)`,hook:`A fierce northern warrior-woman who ripped a cracked two-hundred-pound bronze chime-blade from a fallen mountain watchtower, channeling the howling blizzards of the Frost-Chime Peaks into bone-shattering sonic cleaves.`,kindred:`Human`,image:`characters/brenna-cold-bell/splash`,kind:`teaser`,revealed:!1,art:`A tall, muscular, Amazonian human woman in her mid-thirties with wind-burned fair skin, blue war-paint across her eyes, and thick blonde hair braided with frost-crystals and bronze rings; clad in white crag-yeti furs over verdigris-green scale mail, she swings a colossal, six-foot-long greatsword shaped like a split bronze tuning-fork that trails a roaring vortex of sapphire-blue ice and golden sound-sparks.`,revealWeek:12,revealLine:`The tuning-fork sword. The march north, still with no map of the Crown.`},{id:`lazlo-greaves`,name:`Lazlo Greaves`,calling:`The Pitch-Alchemist`,faction:`solaris-bastion`,factionText:`The Solaris Bastion (Home Region: The Sun-Steppe of Aethel)`,region:`sun-steppe-of-aethel`,regionText:`The Sun-Steppe of Aethel`,role:`healer`,roleText:`Healer / Support (Transmutation Chemist, Elixir-Thrower & Lantern Infuser)`,hook:`A flamboyant, cane-twirling physician, exiled from Brass-Harbor for testing Dead-Pitch on the wounded, who now brews marsh-spore and Amber-glass fogs for the Bastion tents at Last Accord, hurling restorative mist at his friends and acid-pitch at his foes.`,kindred:`Human`,image:`characters/lazlo-greaves/splash`,kind:`teaser`,revealed:!1,art:`A tall, gaunt, theatrical human man in his late forties with a sharp silver-streaked goatee, a brass monocle over one eye, and a high-collared burgundy-and-copper leather greatcoat; atop his shoulders sits an elaborate glass distillery backpack filled with bubbling emerald-green and golden-amber liquids connected by hoses to a brass syringe-gauntlet on his left hand, while his right hand tips his top-hat and tosses three glowing glass potion-grenades into the air.`,revealWeek:15,revealLine:`The hospital tents at Last Accord. He will not say whether a glassed person can be thawed.`,spokenTitle:`Doctor`,station:{location:`last-accord`,text:`Last Accord hospital tents`}},{id:`asha-renn`,name:`Asha Renn`,calling:`The Mirage-Caller`,faction:`verdant-chorus`,factionText:`The Verdant Chorus (Home Region: The Singing Dunes of Kal-Zir)`,region:`singing-dunes-of-kal-zir`,regionText:`The Singing Dunes of Kal-Zir`,role:`ranged`,roleText:`Ranged Damage Dealer (Glass-Sand Summoner & Prism Illusionist)`,hook:`A mysterious desert oracle whose voice can command the metallic copper sands of Kal-Zir to rise into towering bronze-and-glass avatars that fight alongside her and refract her spells across the battlefield.`,kindred:`Auralin`,image:`characters/asha-renn/splash`,kind:`teaser`,revealed:!1,art:`A graceful, barefoot Auralin woman with warm copper-brown skin tattooed with glowing golden harmonic lines, dark eyes, and a hooded mantle of shimmering rose-gold desert silk and tinkling bronze coin-chimes; she stands with arms outstretched in a canyon as two ten-foot-tall humanoid warrior-statues formed of swirling metallic copper sand and glowing amber glass rise out of the ground on either side of her, mimicking her exact stance.`,revealWeek:18,revealLine:`The copper-sand giants. Midpoint art drop, built to be shared.`}],t=`Players create their own Oath-Bearer and choose one of thirteen Callings. The thirteen heroes in this bible are the legendary exemplars of those Callings: named, voiced people in the world, and the models for that Calling’s story and skill tree. Armor dyes, weapon skins, and the build belong to the player. The pre-launch site shows four exemplars in full, one per party role, and nine as teasers.

---`;export{e as characters,t as rosterIntro};